    "detailed_description": "<strong>Sprite Fight</strong> is an action-packed 2D platform fighter with the use of long-ranged combat and the ability to battle your friends. With a series of unique game modes to brawl out together, acquire a variety of weapons through plenty of stages to fend off your opponents and come out victorious.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/8b31207ca0b13cd6f816ace2e5cbb4e1.poster.avif?t=1681299681\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/8b31207ca0b13cd6f816ace2e5cbb4e1.webm?t=1681299681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/8b31207ca0b13cd6f816ace2e5cbb4e1.mp4?t=1681299681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MULTIPLE GAME MODES</h2>What separates <strong>Sprite Fight</strong> from the typical 2D platform fighter is the variety of unique game modes, some being king of the hill, beach ball keep-up, shotgun frenzy, gun game, disk shoot-down, and more to come.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/9e25324f209d2a44fe99d69442c226b3.poster.avif?t=1681299681\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/9e25324f209d2a44fe99d69442c226b3.webm?t=1681299681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/9e25324f209d2a44fe99d69442c226b3.mp4?t=1681299681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TONS OF STAGES</h2>With a multitude of stages, you'll be able to traverse different areas of the <strong>Sprite Fight</strong> world to battle amongst your peers.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/641b1f43348584b8fc179e13a5ec44e3.avif?t=1681299681\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LOTS OF WEAPONS</h2>With over 20+ weapons at your disposal, you'll be able to quickly cycle through your gallery of weapons and attack foes with what you're given.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/13fb895a52f52755d92a180b37eb5094.poster.avif?t=1681299681\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/13fb895a52f52755d92a180b37eb5094.webm?t=1681299681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WACKY PHYSICS</h2>With stages based around your skill to navigate platforms with moving chains and stages where you avoid flying platforms coming at you, the physics system in <strong>Sprite Fight</strong> is a lot to unpack.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/fcd774827af629ff03f6a92bc1f42a9f.poster.avif?t=1681299681\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/fcd774827af629ff03f6a92bc1f42a9f.webm?t=1681299681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/fcd774827af629ff03f6a92bc1f42a9f.mp4?t=1681299681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHARACTER SELECTION</h2>You'll be able to navigate through different cosmetic looks for you to battle your friends with.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/699395f39879d2c1e57a1aacff2b73e2.poster.avif?t=1681299681\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/699395f39879d2c1e57a1aacff2b73e2.apng?t=1681299681\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Sprite Fight</strong> is an action-packed 2D platform fighter with the use of long-ranged combat and the ability to battle your friends. With a series of unique game modes to brawl out together, acquire a variety of weapons through plenty of stages to fend off your opponents and come out victorious.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/8b31207ca0b13cd6f816ace2e5cbb4e1.poster.avif?t=1681299681\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/8b31207ca0b13cd6f816ace2e5cbb4e1.webm?t=1681299681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/8b31207ca0b13cd6f816ace2e5cbb4e1.mp4?t=1681299681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MULTIPLE GAME MODES</h2>What separates <strong>Sprite Fight</strong> from the typical 2D platform fighter is the variety of unique game modes, some being king of the hill, beach ball keep-up, shotgun frenzy, gun game, disk shoot-down, and more to come.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/9e25324f209d2a44fe99d69442c226b3.poster.avif?t=1681299681\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/9e25324f209d2a44fe99d69442c226b3.webm?t=1681299681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/9e25324f209d2a44fe99d69442c226b3.mp4?t=1681299681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TONS OF STAGES</h2>With a multitude of stages, you'll be able to traverse different areas of the <strong>Sprite Fight</strong> world to battle amongst your peers.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/641b1f43348584b8fc179e13a5ec44e3.avif?t=1681299681\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LOTS OF WEAPONS</h2>With over 20+ weapons at your disposal, you'll be able to quickly cycle through your gallery of weapons and attack foes with what you're given.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/13fb895a52f52755d92a180b37eb5094.poster.avif?t=1681299681\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/13fb895a52f52755d92a180b37eb5094.webm?t=1681299681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WACKY PHYSICS</h2>With stages based around your skill to navigate platforms with moving chains and stages where you avoid flying platforms coming at you, the physics system in <strong>Sprite Fight</strong> is a lot to unpack.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/fcd774827af629ff03f6a92bc1f42a9f.poster.avif?t=1681299681\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/fcd774827af629ff03f6a92bc1f42a9f.webm?t=1681299681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/fcd774827af629ff03f6a92bc1f42a9f.mp4?t=1681299681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHARACTER SELECTION</h2>You'll be able to navigate through different cosmetic looks for you to battle your friends with.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/699395f39879d2c1e57a1aacff2b73e2.poster.avif?t=1681299681\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061780/extras/699395f39879d2c1e57a1aacff2b73e2.apng?t=1681299681\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>",
